<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 38.34 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 38.34 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 38.34 million rands worth of South African bonds on Monday after selling 295.45 million rands worth on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
